### Ingest SPY daily prices
POST http://localhost:8080/admin/ingest/SPY

### Ingest QQQ daily prices
POST http://localhost:8080/admin/ingest/QQQ

### Ingest VTI daily prices
POST http://localhost:8080/admin/ingest/VTI

### Get SPY price history
GET http://localhost:8080/api/funds/SPY/prices

### Get Non-Existent Ticker
GET http://localhost:8080/api/funds/ZZZ/prices